      <property name="whatsThis">
       <string>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Piece Categories&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create, edit, reorder, or import categories for the piece browser. The right-hand list shows pieces matching the selected category. Imported and edited categories are saved when you choose OK in Preferences; Export writes the current list immediately.&lt;/p&gt;</string>
